  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Complemento del Programa de Inversin en Agua Potable y Saneamiento</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supplemental Water Supply and Sanitation Investment Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The loan will supplement loan 1048SF-HO, approved in December 1999, for a potable water and sanitation program. The program will finance technical assistance and civil works for medium-sized municipalities that are reforming their provision of potable water and sewerage services.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
